sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant HC as fa:fa-heartbeat Health Check
    participant PD as fa:fa-bell PagerDuty
    participant OC as fa:fa-user-shield On-Call Eng
    participant DNS as fa:fa-globe DNS Layer
    participant DR as fa:fa-server DR Region
    participant DB as fa:fa-database DB Replica
    participant SM as fa:fa-vial Smoke Tests

    Note over HC,SM: Reference runbook for self-managed multi-region deployment

    HC->>HC: GET /health every 10s
    HC->>HC: 3 consecutive failures detected
    HC->>PD: Alert: Primary region unhealthy
    PD->>OC: Page (immediate)

    OC->>DB: Verify replica lag < 60s
    DB-->>OC: Replication lag confirmed

    OC->>DR: Scale up K8s cluster
    Note over DR: kubectl scale deploy --replicas=3

    DR-->>OC: Pods Running + Readiness passed

    OC->>DB: Promote replica to primary
    Note over DB: aws rds promote-read-replica<br/>or gcloud sql promote-replica

    DB-->>OC: Promotion complete

    OC->>OC: Sync object storage (rclone delta)
    OC->>OC: Restore secrets to DR vault

    OC->>DNS: Update DNS record to DR endpoint
    Note over DNS: TTL 30s — propagates in 60-90s

    DNS-->>OC: Propagation confirmed

    OC->>SM: Run synthetic smoke tests
    SM-->>OC: All checks pass

    OC->>OC: Post status update to status page
    Note over OC,SM: Total switchover: 23-53 min (within 2h RTO)
